CONFIG CHANGE nginx/evoserver.conf 2026-10-09, commit 'make every subdomain work after the Cloudflare tunnel change'. The grafana vhost header was replaced and the sink server was deleted:
-    listen 443 ssl;
-    server_name grafana.evoserver.lan *.evoserver.lan;
-    allow 192.168.1.0/24;
-    allow 100.64.0.0/10;
-    deny all;
+    listen 443 ssl default_server;
+    server_name _;
-server {
-    listen 80 default_server;
-    listen 443 ssl default_server;
-    server_name _;
-    return 444;
-}
This vhost proxies to grafana:3000.
